00:53:38.170 --> 00:53:43.619
being used to help the search for extraterrestrial
intelligence. So this algorithm that you can

00:53:43.619 --> 00:53:47.570
download on your computer called SETI@home,
actually basically does that. It essentially

00:53:47.570 --> 00:53:52.050
uses some machine-learning algorithms to scan
through these huge libraries of data, which

00:53:52.050 --> 00:53:56.190
have been collected, all the radio transmissions,
and see if there is anything that looks like

00:53:56.190 --> 00:54:01.829
a significant pattern amongst that data. And
those algorithms are improving all the time,

00:54:01.829 --> 00:54:06.640
and as we get closer and closer towards these
