00:54:06.640 --> 00:54:11.240
that it would greatly help us sift through
more and more data. So yeah, I think you're

00:54:11.240 --> 00:54:17.230
exactly right, that as our software more generally
improves, we can expect to be able to do a

00:54:17.230 --> 00:54:21.950
more complete job of surveying the sky for
advanced civilizations.

00:54:21.950 --> 00:54:27.810
So you tossed this idea in a haphazard way
